    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "honestly it feels like a lot of drama for just a vitamin type thing. i've read some forums where people say it's totally fine as long as you don't take a ton at once. if i just stay on a low dose like 300mg once a day, is it really gonna make my birth control fail? it seems like a stretch that a little tea or pill is gonna overpower my actual medication.",
