      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While some forums might suggest otherwise, the interaction between St. John's Wort and birth control is medically recognized and not simply based on dosage. The supplement can affect how your body processes the hormones in your birth control pills, increasing the risk of failure even at lower doses. For your safety, it is best to avoid combining them without professional medical clearance.",
